{"id":"lm-69b2ecde1b51e2dc0a4306b5","title":"ALM - Community road in Spain","group":"LM Europe","desc":"learnablemeta.com map","cards":[{"q":["https://learnablemeta.com/images/6997/1773334320430-RCi.avif","https://learnablemeta.com/images/6997/1773337986287-Efx.avif"],"a":"Andalusia - Andalusia","slug":"spain","note":"<h1><em>Andalusia</em> use the code <em>A</em></h1>\n<p>But <strong>pay attention</strong> that :</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>A</strong> is also used for <strong>national roads</strong> that you can find everywhere in the country</li>\n<li><strong>A</strong> is also used in <strong>Aragon</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p>However, the name of the region is wrote on the road markers (but not on the generic signs with cities name on it) for Andalusia (see attached pictures), but otherwise, don't search in Andalusiaif you have just a A-XXX road number.</p>"},{"q":["https://learnablemeta.com/images/6997/1773338829746-FAr.avif","https://learnablemeta.com/images/6997/1773338834466-yFq.avif"],"a":"Aragon - Aragon","slug":"spain","note":"<h1><em>Aragon</em> use the code <em>A</em>.</h1>\n<p>But <strong>pay attention</strong> that :</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>A</strong> is also used for <strong>national roads</strong> that you can find everywhere in the country</li>\n<li><strong>A</strong> is also used in <strong>Andalusia</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p>However, the name Andalusia is wrote on the road markers (but not on the generic signs with cities name on it). You can also use the fact that the signs (for those that have road numbers only) have black border in Aragon (check also the image of the sign attached here). Otherwise, don't search in Aragonif you have just a A-XXX road number, search for a confirmation first.</p>"},{"q":["https://learnablemeta.com/images/6997/1773339257575-XGY.avif","https://learnablemeta.com/images/6997/1773339266674-LjO.avif"],"a":"Asturias - Asturias","slug":"spain","note":"<h1><em>Asturias</em> use the code <em>AS</em>.</h1>"},{"q":["https://learnablemeta.com/images/6997/1773339427712-spt.avif","https://learnablemeta.com/images/6997/1773339433705-NYC.avif"],"a":"Cantabria - Cantabria","slug":"spain","note":"<h1><em>Cantabria</em> use the code <em>CA</em>.</h1>\n<p>Be careful that you can also rarely find the letter <em>S</em>.</p>"},{"q":["https://learnablemeta.com/images/6997/1773342585989-Udk.avif","https://learnablemeta.com/images/6997/1773342591173-isv.avif"],"a":"Castile - Castile-La-Mancha","slug":"spain","note":"<h1><em>Castile-La-Mancha</em> use the code <em>CM</em>.</h1>"},{"q":["https://learnablemeta.com/images/6997/1773339677474-thC.avif","https://learnablemeta.com/images/6997/1773339684117-ioY.avif"],"a":"Castile and León - Castile and León","slug":"spain","note":"<h1><em>Castile and León</em> use the code <em>CL</em>.</h1>"},{"q":["https://learnablemeta.com/images/6997/1773340110142-gSZ.avif","https://learnablemeta.com/images/6997/1773340118700-Dl9.avif"],"a":"Catalonia - Catalonia","slug":"spain","note":"<h1><em>Catalonia</em> use the code <em>C</em>.</h1>"},{"q":["https://learnablemeta.com/images/6997/1773340289743-hYg.avif","https://learnablemeta.com/images/6997/1773340301197-cRS.avif"],"a":"Community of Madrid - Community of Madrid","slug":"spain","note":"<h1><em>Community of Madrid</em> use the code <em>M</em>.</h1>"},{"q":["https://learnablemeta.com/images/6997/1773340592269-YKW.avif","https://learnablemeta.com/images/6997/1773340598146-a8U.avif"],"a":"Extremadura - Extremadura","slug":"spain","note":"<h1><em>Extremadura</em> use the code <em>EX</em>.</h1>"},{"q":["https://learnablemeta.com/images/6997/1773340762091-cjL.avif","https://learnablemeta.com/images/6997/1773340780940-Blu.avif"],"a":"Galicia - Galicia","slug":"spain","note":"<h1><em>Galicia</em> use the code <em>AG</em>.</h1>"},{"q":["https://learnablemeta.com/images/6997/1773340889085-kFw.avif","https://learnablemeta.com/images/6997/1773340896019-Bv4.avif"],"a":"La Rioja - La Rioja","slug":"spain","note":"<h1><em>La Rioja</em> use the code <em>LR</em>.</h1>"},{"q":["https://learnablemeta.com/images/6997/1773341013679-loG.avif","https://learnablemeta.com/images/6997/1773341022212-AIR.avif"],"a":"Navarre - Navarre","slug":"spain","note":"<h1><em>Navarre</em> use the code <em>NA</em>.</h1>"},{"q":["https://learnablemeta.com/images/6997/1773341281520-IhB.avif","https://learnablemeta.com/images/6997/1773341291995-2Ss.avif"],"a":"Region of Murcia - Region of Murcia","slug":"spain","note":"<h1><em>Region of Murcia</em> use the code <em>RM</em> or <em>MU</em></h1>\n<p>Be careful that the codes are sometimes swapped between the map and Street View (RM on SV and MU on the map, or the opposite), so if you have a community road number, search without giving to much trust into the map's codes, and more in the number itself for this region</p>"},{"q":["https://learnablemeta.com/images/6997/1773341616453-8X8.avif","https://learnablemeta.com/images/6997/1773341634070-avr.avif"],"a":"Valencian Community - Valencian Community","slug":"spain","note":"<h1><em>Valencian Community</em> use the code <em>CV</em>.</h1>"}]}